{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Darkest Cube</i>, you take control of one of five adventurers and explore the world of Kryom by choosing different branching paths. Along the way, you'll face enemies in turn-based, strategic card battles. Success depends on managing your energy, building smart card synergies, reading enemy patterns, and knowing when to retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through quests and encounters, you earn new cards and resources to strengthen your deck or build entirely new ones. With each upgrade, you prepare for the ultimate threat: the Dark Cubes\u2014powerful magical objects that unleash dangerous creatures into the world. Each Cube introduces a unique mechanic you must solve to seal it. If you fail, the Cube resets, forcing you to refine your strategy. Every run offers new paths, challenges, and surprises.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650350?t=1759914123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650350/c388f1354fef415167ef66284ea576f060223d87/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759914123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650350/2dcbb9df129547b8dd09512442472a0c9b48c34c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759914123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650350/2dcbb9df129547b8dd09512442472a0c9b48c34c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759914123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Darkest Cube</i>, you take control of one of five adventurers and explore the world of Kryom by choosing different branching paths. Along the way, you'll face enemies in turn-based, strategic card battles. Success depends on managing your energy, building smart card synergies, reading enemy patterns, and knowing when to retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through quests and encounters, you earn new cards and resources to strengthen your deck or build entirely new ones. With each upgrade, you prepare for the ultimate threat: the Dark Cubes\u2014powerful magical objects that unleash dangerous creatures into the world. Each Cube introduces a unique mechanic you must solve to seal it. If you fail, the Cube resets, forcing you to refine your strategy. Every run offers new paths, challenges, and surprises.</p>","developers":["PEC Game Design"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650350/30170dc647eb57a6d1de423fad4af8ef4fc5b677/header.jpg?t=1759914123","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 PEC Game Design GmbH. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650350/386748539/d0fbb108371c2e58f586cadc910953760725f0db/1759911472/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759914121","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650350/386748539/d0fbb108371c2e58f586cadc910953760725f0db/1759911472/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759914121","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650350/386748539/d0fbb108371c2e58f586cadc910953760725f0db/1759911472/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759914121","id":257164464,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164464/movie480.mp4?t=1759914121","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164464/movie_max.mp4?t=1759914121"},"name":"Gameplay of Darkest Cube ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164464/78d526014d107